#: src/admin/documentation.php:34
msgid "Overview"
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/documentation.php:36
msgid "Forms that work out the institutional email address of São Paulo students and teachers, of the city schools (RME/SP) or of the state schools (SEDUC-SP). The address is worked out in the visitor's browser, so nothing typed reaches the site."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/documentation.php:38
msgid "Places the form on any page or post, opening with a profile selector for students and teachers; with only one form offered, it shows that one. The Copy button on the General tab copies it."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/documentation.php:39
msgid "Shows only the students' form, with no selector; form=\"teachers\" shows only the teachers'."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/documentation.php:40
msgid "Serves the state schools on that page, whatever the General tab says; network=\"city\" serves the city schools."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/documentation.php:41
msgid "Every release also publishes a single HTML file with both forms and the profile selector, for an iframe on a site without WordPress; add ?form=students or ?form=teachers to its address for one form alone, and ?network=state for the state schools. It uses the built-in defaults, not these settings."
msgstr ""

